# Pairs with BackupSagaConsistent. REPRODUCES CURRENT PRODUCTION (#4485): the
# snapshot path discards the registry decisions, so a bucket still pending is
# served pre-saga whatever was decided. A capture taken while a committed
# saga's terminal fan-out is half done then holds one shard post-saga
# (terminal applied) and another pre-saga (bucket pending). Confirmed by
# execution against production; see the issue.
MODULE: BackupSagaConsistentPendingReadsPre
TARGET: BackupSagaConsistent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a still-pending bucket is served pre-saga regardless of the decision (#4485)

--- FIND
         THEN (IF d0[TreeOf[sh]][t] = "committed" THEN "post" ELSE "pre")
--- REPLACE
         \* MUTATION: the decision snapshot is never consulted.
         THEN "pre"
--- END
